---
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';
import { SITE } from '../site.config.mjs';
---
<Page title="About" kicker={SITE.location} description={`About ${SITE.name}.`}>
  <div class="about">
    <div class="prose">
      <p class="big">{SITE.tagline}</p>
      <p>Placeholder bio. Two or three short paragraphs: what you do, what you're into right now, and what you'd like to be asked about. Write it like you'd say it to someone who just tapped your card.</p>
      <p>Placeholder paragraph two. A specific detail beats an adjective: "I rebuilt my dad's lathe controller" says more than "passionate maker".</p>
      <h2>Now</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Placeholder: what you're building this month</li>
        <li>Placeholder: what you're learning</li>
        <li>Placeholder: what you're reading</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <aside>
      <h2 class="px">Elsewhere</h2>
      <ul class="links">
        {SITE.links.map((l) => <li><a href={l.href} rel={l.href.startsWith('http') ? 'me noopener' : undefined}>{l.label} <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></li>)}
      </ul>
    </aside>
  </div>
</Page>
<style>
  .about { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 8fr) minmax(0, 4fr); gap: calc(var(--u) * 6); }
  .big { font-size: var(--step-2); line-height: 1.3; letter-spacing: -0.01em; }
  aside h2 { margin: 0 0 12px; font-weight: 400; }
  .links { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; border-top: 2px solid var(--ink); }
  .links a { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; padding: 14px 4px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ink); text-decoration: none; font-weight: 700; }
  .links a:hover { background: var(--ink); color: var(--paper); }
  @media (max-width: 760px) { .about { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
</style>
